            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3228] Interpreter dependencies are not downloaded on zeppelin start - regression issue</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3228</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Same issue that &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1143&quot; title=&quot;Interpreter dependencies are not downloaded on zeppelin start&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-1143&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-1143&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. It seems to have been caused by code refactorings.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When zeppelin is started/restarted, server should try and download dependencies.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
